# Template for the ros2 package's Debian control file.
#
# Carries over the deb_info block from the ros2 recipe in swsoc-elxr-config
# (boards/arm64/simaai/packages/ros2/ros2.yaml). Placeholders are substituted
# by packaging/build-ros2-deb.sh:
#
#   @VERSION@         packaging/version, plus a +sima.<date>.<sha> suffix
#   @ARCH@            the build host's Debian architecture
#   @INSTALLED_SIZE@  measured from the staged tree
#   @DEPENDS@         packaging/runtime-depends.txt, comma separated
#
# Lines beginning with # are stripped before the control file is written.
Package: ros2
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Section: embedded
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Open Source Robotics Foundation, Inc.
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Description: Robot Operating System 2 (ROS2)
 ROS 2 Jazzy, built from the repository set pinned in ros2.repos, installed
 under /usr/local/ros2. Includes the SiMa rosbag2 fork, whose MCAP storage
 plugin evicts written pages from the page cache so long recordings do not
 starve the SoC's contiguous memory allocator.
